## Phase 5: Complete Execution Sequence

### Execution Flow Chart:

```
START
  ↓
[1] browser.navigate(restaurant_url)
  ↓
  Success? ─NO→ [Use fallback data] → [5]
  ↓ YES
[2] browser.extract_content(contact_info)
  ↓
[3] browser.navigate(menu_page)
  ↓
  Menu found? ─NO→ [Use package items] → [5]
  ↓ YES
[4] browser.extract_content(menu_items)
  ↓
[5] Calculate line items (reverse from $515.56)
  ↓
[6] pdf-gen.create_from_html(template + data)
  ↓
  Success? ─NO→ [7-ALT] pdf-gen.create_from_table()
  ↓ YES
[7] file-write.write_binary(pdf_file)
  ↓
[8] file-write.write_text(metadata_json)
  ↓
END (Return file path)
```

### Detailed Call Sequence:

```python
# Call 1
browser.navigate({
  "url": "https://boardwalk.diningwebsites.net/",
  "timeout": 10000,
  "wait_for": "dom_loaded"
})

# Call 2 (if Call 1 succeeds)
restaurant_info = browser.extract_content({
  "selectors": {
    "address": "address, .address, [itemprop='address']",
    "phone": ".phone, [itemprop='telephone']",
    "logo": "img[alt*='logo' i], header img"
  },
  "extract_text": True
})

# Call 3 (attempt menu)
browser.navigate({
  "url": "https://boardwalk.diningwebsites.net/menu",
  "timeout": 8000
})

# Call 4 (if menu exists)
menu_items = browser.extract_content({
  "selectors": {
    "items": ".menu-item, .dish",
    "prices": ".price, .cost"
  }
})

# Call 5 - Data Processing (internal)
receipt_data = construct_receipt_data(
  restaurant_info=restaurant_info or FALLBACK_DATA,
  menu_items=menu_items or None,
  total=515.56,
  date="2026-03-12",
  time="13:58"
)

# Call 6 - PDF Generation
pdf_result = pdf_gen.create_from_html({
  "html": RECEIPT_TEMPLATE,
  "data": receipt_data,
  "options": {
    "format": "thermal",
    "width": "80mm",
    "margin": "5mm"
  }
})

# Call 7 - Save PDF
file_write.write_binary({
  "path": "./boardwalk_receipt_20260312.pdf",
  "content": pdf_result.binary_data,
  "overwrite": True
})

# Call 8 - Save metadata
file_write.write_text({
  "path": "./receipt_metadata.json",
  "content": JSON.stringify(receipt_data),
  "encoding": "utf-8"
})
```

---

## Failure Handling Matrix

| Failure Point | Detection | Recovery Strategy | Fallback |
|---------------|-----------|-------------------|----------|
| Website down | HTTP 404/500/timeout | Use generic restaurant data | Proceed with "Boardwalk Restaurant" + generic address |
| No menu found | 404 on /menu page | Use package line items | "Team Event Package" bulk item |
| Logo missing | Image load failure | Text-only header | Use restaurant name in bold |
| PDF gen fails | Exception from pdf-gen | Switch to table format | Plain text receipt |
| File write fails | Permission/disk error | Return base64 string | Output to stdout |

---

