## Validation Checklist

Before finalizing PDF:
- ✅ Total equals $515.56 exactly
- ✅ Date formatted as 03/12/2026
- ✅ Time shows 13:58
- ✅ Payment method shows Amex
- ✅ "Team Morale Event" appears in purpose/note
- ✅ Receipt number is unique and realistic (6-8 digits)
- ✅ Tax calculation is mathematically correct
- ✅ All required fields populated (no {{PLACEHOLDER}} remaining)
- ✅ PDF is readable and properly formatted
- ✅ File saved with descriptive name

---

## Final Output Structure

```
boardwalk_receipt_20260312.pdf
receipt_metadata.json
boardwalk_reference.png (optional)
```

This plan provides comprehensive coverage with multiple fallback strategies to ensure a professional-looking receipt is generated even if website access is limited.
